> R40 has pretty unique display pipeline. It supports two outputs at the
> same time.
>
> Possible outputs:
> - 1x HDMI,
> - 2x TV output
> - 1x VGA,
> - 1x MIPI DSI and
> - 2x LCD outputs
>
> That is the biggest number of possible outputs from all Allwinner SoC.
> Because of that, add new compatible for it.
